<title>UK: Sweden sets 150 bln lire 10-year structured bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 150 bln lire 10-year structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *11.0 PCT  MATURITY ***05.MAR 07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  101	 PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER  **99.325    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR TWO YEARS, THEN 19 LESS TWO TIMES 6ML</p>
<p>		**RECOMMENDED</p>
<p>		***CALL AT PAR ON 05.MAR.99</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   1.625</p>
